== the settings ==
tab width 8, from the environment's HEROES_EDITOR_TEXT__TAB_WIDTH
key f2 runs save, from build/editor-demo/editor.toml
key f3 runs find_next, from build/editor-demo/editor.toml
key ctrl-l runs none, from build/editor-demo/editor.toml
key ctrl-s runs save, from the defaults
colours: status from build/editor-demo/editor.toml, found from build/editor-demo/editor.toml

