== moving by graphemes and words ==
down, then four times right over "café": UTF-8 · LF · Ln 2, Col 5 · 3/4
left, then alt-i: "é" U+0065 U+0301, 2 code point(s), 1 column(s); UTF-8 65 CC 81
down keeps the screen column, past the flag's two: UTF-8 · LF · Ln 3, Col 3 · 3/4
home, then right steps over the whole flag: UTF-8 · LF · Ln 3, Col 2 · 3/4
two words right: "pasta", then past the family to "for": UTF-8 · LF · Ln 3, Col 15 · 3/4
a word left, then two left: the family is one step: UTF-8 · LF · Ln 3, Col 10 · 3/4
alt-i on it: "👨‍👩‍👧" U+1F468 U+200D U+1F469 U+200D U+1F467, 5 code point(s), 2 column(s); UTF-8 F0 9F 91 A8 E2 80 8D F0 9F 91 A9 E2 80 8D F0 9F 91 A7
down into Japanese, two cells a character: UTF-8 · LF · Ln 4, Col 6 · 3/4

