  |8                                                           |
  |                                                            |
  | build/editor-demo/notes.txt UTF-8 · LF · Ln 5, Col 1 · 3/4 |
  |/(\w+)@(\w+)\.org/: match 1 of 2                            |
the match the cursor is on: black on bright_green bold; the other: black on bright_yellow
f3, bound to find_next by editor.toml: /(\w+)@(\w+)\.org/: match 2 of 2
ctrl-n: /(\w+)@(\w+)\.org/: match 1 of 2, the search wrapped
ctrl-f (unclosed: /(unclosed/ is no pattern: a group opened by `(` is never closed: its `)` is missing, at byte 0 of "(unclosed"

