== the keys ==
[f1, two pages and a line down] the cursor hidden
  | greeting.txt │ japanese.txt │ notes.txt │ prices.txt       |
  |keys               command         what it does             |
  |ctrl-z             undo            undo the last change     |
  |ctrl-y             redo            redo the change undone   |
  |ctrl-f             find            find a regular expression|
  |ctrl-n, f3         find_next       the next match           |
  |ctrl-p             find_previous   the match before         |
  |ctrl-r             replace         replace matches, with $1 |
  |alt-i              describe        the character's code poin|
  |ctrl-s, f2         save            save in the file's encodi|
