== leaving ==
"jam" typed in notes.txt, "!" in japanese.txt, then ctrl-q asks: modified: japanese.txt, notes.txt; leave? y, n
n, then ctrl-w asks: japanese.txt is modified: save it first? y, n, Esc
y: build/editor-demo/japanese.txt closed
ctrl-q asks: modified: notes.txt; leave? y, n
y: the editor is done: true; 3 files watched
its watches closed: 0 left
removed build/editor-demo
